WEBVTT

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.070
Hey, what's happening? What's going on?

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.820
Jesus of Nazareth is passing by.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.380
Jesus!

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.070
Jesus!

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:51.530
Son of David, have mercy on me!

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.750
What do you want Me to do for you?

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.530
I want to see again.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:09.450
Then see.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.550
Your faith has made you well.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.260
I can see!

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:19.190
I can see!

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:23.260
I can see!

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:36.510
Praise God! Ah! He can see! It’s a miracle! His eyes are healed! Praise the Lord! Amazing! How wonderful!
